            <ArticleTitle>Pulsed electromagnetic energy therapy in third molar surgery.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>748-54</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Pulsed electromagnetic energy is being increasingly employed to reduced symptoms and enhance the healing process following tissue injury. A double-blind placebo-controlled trial has been carried out to assess the value of electromagnetic energy in third molar surgery, but no significant benefit has been found.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
